WEBVTT

00:00:00.230 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.610
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:19.080 --> 00:00:21.200
Sure is summer vacation.

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:25.630
There is no break in our work, so it does not feel like much of a vacation.

00:00:25.630 --> 00:00:26.710
Oh, almost forgot!

00:00:27.040 --> 00:00:32.470
Speaking of work, Shiny Smile's about to debut our new Premium Rare Dress!

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:35.840
That will be quite the occasion!

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:36.890
Yeah!

00:00:36.890 --> 00:00:41.600
And beyond the dress itself, I want to make the event really pop! {both ways work ambiguity}

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:45.480
Like, get everyone get all thrilled and excited!

00:00:47.110 --> 00:00:49.610
I was thinking that would be something you'd say.

00:00:50.070 --> 00:00:53.610
Do you remember what you did long ago at the sanatorium? {jisho suggests sanatorium, this is the first time Lily's ever called it that}{isn't hospice for terminally ill people? we can just use hospital if you don't want to use sanatorium}

00:00:54.070 --> 00:00:58.490
You set up a treasure hunt to entertain me.

00:01:00.030 --> 00:01:02.790
It was a thrilling and exciting experience.

00:01:05.330 --> 00:01:07.580
It is a precious memory of mine.

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:11.710
All right, that settles it!

00:01:12.550 --> 00:01:16.130
I'm gonna make the best treasure hunt event ever!

00:03:00.950 --> 00:03:02.450
Wow!

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:05.540
A huge stage!

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:07.290
A pool and waterfall!

00:03:07.290 --> 00:03:10.290
There's greenery and flowers everywhere you look.

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:12.790
I even spot cafes and shops!

00:03:12.790 --> 00:03:15.040
Yuzu-senpai doesn't hold back.

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:19.130
Who'd have thought to include a treasure hunt in a Premium Rare Dress premiere?{première?}

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:21.430
Her brain just works differently!

00:03:21.430 --> 00:03:22.340
Yume-chan!

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:23.180
Rola-chan!

00:03:26.140 --> 00:03:28.770
A lot of fans of Shiny Smile have come to watch.

00:03:28.770 --> 00:03:29.640
Yep!

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:31.310
That gets me going!

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:34.940
Me too! I can hardly contain my excitement!

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:36.520
Hey!

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:38.780
That voice...

00:03:39.240 --> 00:03:42.030
Hi girls, it's Kirara!

00:03:42.030 --> 00:03:44.450
Wh-Why have you come?!

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:48.490
Yuzu-chan invited us too!

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:50.580
"Y-Yuzu-chan"?

00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:54.380
Rei-san, Elza-san, aren't you going to participate?

00:03:54.380 --> 00:03:56.290
An intriguing proposition.

00:03:56.290 --> 00:03:58.880
However, we'll just watch from the sidelines.

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:04.260
I have come to observe Yuzu Nikaidou's Premium Rare Dress.

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:07.100
Nothing more nor less.{I guess... this is... fine...}

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:12.690
Elza, we have some time before the unveiling.

00:04:12.690 --> 00:04:13.940
Shall we wait at a café?

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:16.400
That sounds splendid.

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:20.440
See you later, Elza-sama!

00:04:21.900 --> 00:04:24.910
Anyway, Kirara's gonna take part!

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:26.700
Let's work together, Ako-chan!

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:30.910
I have not the slightest intention of cooperating with the likes of you!

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:32.120
Hiss!

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:33.330
Oh yeah?

00:04:33.330 --> 00:04:34.790
Baa!

00:04:34.790 --> 00:04:35.460
Hiss!

00:04:35.460 --> 00:04:36.130
Baa!

00:04:36.130 --> 00:04:36.880
Hiss!

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:37.670
Baa!

00:04:50.260 --> 00:04:53.940
Yah-ho! Nikaidou Yuzu here! {I think I did this before?}{anything such should okay}

00:04:53.940 --> 00:04:55.770
Along with Shirogane Lily.

00:04:57.770 --> 00:05:00.610
I wonder where they got a treasure chest that big.

00:05:00.610 --> 00:05:02.780
A lot of effort was put into the production.

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:06.660
Now then, let's get right into the event.

00:05:06.660 --> 00:05:08.370
The rules are simple:

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:13.580
There's a treasure hidden somewhere in the park, so pair up and try to find it!

00:05:13.580 --> 00:05:16.290
Yuzu, what is the treasure?

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:20.880
Well, it's... a secret!

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:24.800
But I promise it's something you'll all love!

00:05:25.380 --> 00:05:27.760
Something we'll love?

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:29.430
Sounds exciting.

00:05:29.430 --> 00:05:32.680
All right, let's pick the pairs!

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:38.650
Kirara-chan, let's do our best.

00:05:38.650 --> 00:05:40.060
Yep, yep!

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:43.190
It gets me going to be in a pair with you.

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:44.070
Me too.

00:05:44.070 --> 00:05:46.700
We can finally revive our adventure activities!

00:05:46.700 --> 00:05:47.820
Also known as...

00:05:47.820 --> 00:05:49.820
Advenkatsu!

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:51.780
On your marks!

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:53.330
Get set...

00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:54.790
Start!

00:05:55.620 --> 00:05:56.960
Where should we look first?

00:05:56.960 --> 00:06:00.330
Kirara just saw something that looked like a treasure box!

00:06:00.330 --> 00:06:00.920
Huh?

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:02.210
Let's go!

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:03.840
Hey, wait up!

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:06.340
Where do you think it is, Rola?

00:06:06.340 --> 00:06:09.680
It must be somewhere only Yuzu-senpai would go.

00:06:09.680 --> 00:06:13.010
Wasn't she really good at climbing trees?

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:14.600
Sounds good to me!

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:15.850
Okay!

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:21.440
According to my experience, treasures are found in caves.

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:23.610
But where could there be a cave?

00:06:24.230 --> 00:06:26.650
That location catches my eye.

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:28.700
I've seen it in movies before.

00:06:28.700 --> 00:06:31.620
There are always hidden caves behind waterfalls!

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:33.870
Sure, let's check it out!

00:06:33.870 --> 00:06:35.080
Onwards!

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:43.880
Advenkatsu! Advenkatsu! Advenkatsu!

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:45.300
Advenka—

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:46.670
Found it!

00:06:46.670 --> 00:06:47.550
Really?

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:50.090
As I suspected.

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:51.640
Ako-chan, you're amazing!

00:07:06.820 --> 00:07:09.150
Oh, I forgot to tell you!

00:07:09.150 --> 00:07:13.320
There are fakes too, so make sure you find the real one!

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:19.830
"Miss"...?

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:21.620
Baa!

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:24.000
I get it.

00:07:24.000 --> 00:07:28.510
I expected it to be in a tree, but a palm tree?

00:07:29.260 --> 00:07:30.970
What now, Mahiru?

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:32.470
Only one thing to do.

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:34.800
Prepare yourselves!

00:07:43.020 --> 00:07:44.770
That gets me going!

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:49.690
I'm not done yet!

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:55.660
Ako-chan, look here.

00:07:56.120 --> 00:07:57.870
You think it's this one?

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:02.960
It absolutely, positively must be!

00:08:04.830 --> 00:08:06.630
Got it!

00:08:20.770 --> 00:08:22.890
It's a miss.

00:08:23.980 --> 00:08:26.900
Kirara-chan, can Caroline really find it?

00:08:26.900 --> 00:08:28.860
Just leave it to her!

00:08:28.860 --> 00:08:30.400
Okay, Caroline!

00:08:30.400 --> 00:08:33.110
Baa where to dig! Baa!

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:36.410
Found it!

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:40.660
Another miss...

00:08:41.040 --> 00:08:43.080
Looks like they're all having fun.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:49.380
But it is possible that they may not find the real one for all eternity.

00:08:49.380 --> 00:08:52.210
In that case, let's give out a hint!

00:08:52.210 --> 00:08:54.970
Lilienne, if you would!

00:08:56.220 --> 00:08:59.050
I will now provide a hint.

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:03.060
A treasure searched for cannot be found. {this appears to be custom made}{can we ban these kinds of characters from anime}

00:09:03.060 --> 00:09:06.440
Only when one gives up do they find it.

00:09:06.850 --> 00:09:09.060
What's she mean, Yume-chan?

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:13.440
Maybe it's hidden somewhere you go after you give up on looking.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:16.320
So, where would that be?

00:09:16.320 --> 00:09:19.200
Somewhere you go when you're tired of searching...

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:21.830
I would want to take a break.

00:09:21.830 --> 00:09:23.410
Then you'd go...

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:35.880
There it is!

00:09:56.570 --> 00:09:58.360
Too bad.

00:09:58.860 --> 00:10:01.240
Another miss?

00:10:02.620 --> 00:10:06.000
Where's the real treasure?! {in your hearts, of course}

00:10:23.350 --> 00:10:25.930
The event looks to be heating up.

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:27.940
That's splendid.

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:32.940
Nevertheless, I have eyes only for Star Premium Rare Coords.

00:10:33.270 --> 00:10:36.440
Five people currently have Star Wings, right?

00:10:36.440 --> 00:10:39.530
Yes, yet it is still not enough.

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:40.950
Not enough?

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:44.490
Elza, I think it's about time.

00:10:44.490 --> 00:10:47.830
Would you tell me why you're so focused on Star Premium Rare Coords?

00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:55.340
Very well, it may be for the best if you knew my true objective.

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:57.630
Your true objective?

00:10:57.630 --> 00:10:58.590
Yes.

00:10:58.590 --> 00:11:06.100
The number of Star Wings—in other words, 
Star Premium Rare Coords, is said to be nine in total.

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:09.640
I possess Venus,

00:11:09.980 --> 00:11:11.980
Lily has Pluto,

00:11:12.270 --> 00:11:13.980
Kirara has Mercury,

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:16.440
Mahiru has Neptune,

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:18.690
and Rola has Mars.

00:11:18.690 --> 00:11:20.820
Four remain.{is the ninth one earth? or moon?}

00:11:21.740 --> 00:11:25.200
When all nine Star Premium Rare Coords have been assembled,

00:11:25.870 --> 00:11:29.160
the Sun Dress will come forth.

00:11:30.960 --> 00:11:32.580
The Sun Dress... {unique term thus far, might as well go with it}{hopefully in ten years they won't have a サンドレス}

00:11:33.920 --> 00:11:40.340
The miracle dress that reigns over the planets, able to illuminate even the darkest abyss.{I don't really this use of miraculous (dress of miracles of better probably) but it's used in enough translations that it's sort of a part of weeb translatery so}

00:11:40.340 --> 00:11:44.680
I want to obtain the Sun Dress at any cost.

00:11:44.680 --> 00:11:51.690
Is that why you've been gathering skilled idols with the potential to gain Star Premium Rare Dresses?

00:11:51.690 --> 00:11:55.520
Yes, and that includes you, Rei.

00:11:59.820 --> 00:12:02.360
Everyone has such nice smiles.

00:12:02.360 --> 00:12:05.320
The event is a real success, Yuzu.

00:12:06.450 --> 00:12:07.330
Yuzu?

00:12:07.330 --> 00:12:09.120
Lilienne!

00:12:09.120 --> 00:12:11.370
I can't hold back any more!

00:12:11.370 --> 00:12:14.540
Yuzu's gonna go search with everyone else!

00:12:18.590 --> 00:12:20.380
Let me join you!

00:12:20.380 --> 00:12:24.590
Huh?! But you're the one who hid the treasure.

00:12:24.590 --> 00:12:26.300
Don't worry one bit!

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:29.260
I forgot where I hid it!

00:12:29.260 --> 00:12:30.640
What?!

00:12:33.890 --> 00:12:37.020
It appears I have no choice. Moving on...

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:40.650
I will present you with the second hint.

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:47.160
When faced directly with a treasure, 
people usually do not realize its identity.

00:12:47.160 --> 00:12:49.540
They don't realize it's a treasure?

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:51.620
It's like a riddle. {this is the best I can do for まるで頓智みたいだね｡ for now}{something something moral of a fable}

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:56.250
At times like this, I simply have to do a full scan of my mental database...

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:57.170
Tick tick tick tick...

00:12:57.170 --> 00:12:59.170
Anyway, we've just gotta look!

00:12:59.170 --> 00:13:00.170
Right.

00:13:00.170 --> 00:13:01.550
Okay.

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:03.970
Ako-chan, we should go too!

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:07.760
Wait!

00:13:08.890 --> 00:13:11.310
Where's the treasure?

00:13:11.310 --> 00:13:12.560
Found it!

00:13:12.560 --> 00:13:14.560
Kirara found one too!

00:13:16.060 --> 00:13:18.310
They're empty!

00:13:20.820 --> 00:13:22.320
Nothing...

00:13:22.320 --> 00:13:24.070
Ah, look!

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:25.570
Sitting right in the open!

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:26.570
Yeah!

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:31.120
Yay!

00:13:34.830 --> 00:13:38.460
Now then, I will present the final hint.

00:13:40.380 --> 00:13:44.260
The true treasure is in meeting with others. {just note to see if I feel like making encounter fit in}

00:13:44.260 --> 00:13:47.260
That's not a real hint!

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:51.260
But there's no way Lily-senpai would ever say anything meaningless.

00:13:51.260 --> 00:13:53.270
Let's go over everything from the beginning.

00:13:53.270 --> 00:13:56.100
Okay, starting with the first hint...

00:13:56.100 --> 00:14:01.940
If you search for it you can't find it. 
Only when you give up can it be found.

00:14:01.940 --> 00:14:03.570
Then the next hint.

00:14:03.570 --> 00:14:09.280
When faced directly with a treasure, people usually do not realize its identity.

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:15.290
And the final hint is that the true treasure is in meeting with others.

00:14:15.290 --> 00:14:19.290
When you stop searching, it's right in front of you...

00:14:20.330 --> 00:14:21.540
That's it!

00:14:22.130 --> 00:14:23.250
Yume?

00:14:23.250 --> 00:14:26.510
What, what? You figure it out, Yume-chan?

00:14:26.510 --> 00:14:28.090
Let's go, Mahiru!

00:14:28.090 --> 00:14:28.970
Okay!

00:14:31.510 --> 00:14:34.260
That was terrible of her.

00:14:34.600 --> 00:14:39.810
Yuzu-senpai went all-out, even going so far as to set up a pitfall.

00:14:40.350 --> 00:14:43.980
All we can do is fill up on energy and get back at it. {or just sugar}

00:14:43.980 --> 00:14:45.230
Good plan.

00:14:48.110 --> 00:14:50.110
Wh-What now?

00:14:50.110 --> 00:14:51.120
I don't know...

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:54.410
Yume-chan found the treasure box!

00:14:54.410 --> 00:14:55.370
What?

00:14:55.370 --> 00:14:56.250
Koharu!

00:14:56.250 --> 00:14:57.370
Right!

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:06.550
I knew it! This is the real thing.

00:15:06.550 --> 00:15:08.720
What do you mean, Yume-chan?

00:15:08.720 --> 00:15:11.140
Isn't that just a stage prop?

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:16.100
Yuzu-senpai and Lily-senpai just used it for their grand entrance.

00:15:16.850 --> 00:15:21.810
The flashy entrance was just a ploy to trick us into thinking it was a prop.

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:25.690
If this was the real one, we'd never find it by looking elsewhere.

00:15:25.690 --> 00:15:30.860
You mean we didn't realize it was right here because we thought it was part of the set?

00:15:31.450 --> 00:15:33.910
But what about the last hint?

00:15:33.910 --> 00:15:37.740
It was "the true treasure is in meeting with others".

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:43.000
If it's about meeting others, then maybe inside of this...

00:15:54.800 --> 00:15:56.560
That was a magnificent deduction.

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:58.270
You win!

00:15:58.270 --> 00:16:01.270
Thanks for finding us, Yume-chan!

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:03.900
Tsubasa-senpai and Yozora-senpai...

00:16:03.900 --> 00:16:05.940
Even Hime-senpai!

00:16:11.200 --> 00:16:13.700
So the treasure was Hime-senpai...

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:15.160
Yozora-senpai...

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:16.700
And Tsubasa-senpai!

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:21.710
Wonderful! The Yume-san and Kirara-san pair found the true treasure:

00:16:21.710 --> 00:16:25.750
S4, the 25th Generation!

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:28.960
Yume-chan, Kirara-chan, you nailed it!

00:16:28.960 --> 00:16:31.970
But why are you all here?

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:38.430
The girls all happened to be back in Japan, so I called them up for the surprise.

00:16:38.430 --> 00:16:41.730
This is the best surprise ever!

00:16:42.980 --> 00:16:45.190
And now, what I've been waiting for...

00:16:45.190 --> 00:16:46.980
Yume-chan, it's been so long!

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:54.110
You've matured a lot in the short time I've been away.

00:16:54.110 --> 00:16:56.910
And you're as beautiful as ever, Hime-senpai!

00:16:57.490 --> 00:16:59.080
This is unbelievable!

00:16:59.080 --> 00:17:01.500
You're really here!

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:04.960
We'll be spending the remainder of the summer here.

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:06.080
And in fact...

00:17:06.080 --> 00:17:08.040
Since we're all here...

00:17:08.040 --> 00:17:09.670
For a limited time only...

00:17:09.670 --> 00:17:12.010
We're reviving our group! {um, reforming? re...S4ing?}{I believe "revival" is the typical english term for this but}

00:17:15.430 --> 00:17:19.260
Aikatsu Island is coming back again this year, so we can go together! {ahh, so that's where the crossover will be}

00:17:19.260 --> 00:17:24.640
Yes! I feel like I'm dreaming, 
getting to Aikatsu with you again.

00:17:27.100 --> 00:17:29.770
It's no dream, see?

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:36.360
As the party is in full swing, it is time for the stage performance.

00:17:36.360 --> 00:17:37.740
What performance?

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:40.990
Today is the debut of your Premium Rare Dress.

00:17:40.990 --> 00:17:43.790
Oh! I totally forgot!

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:48.290
Really? We were so looking forward to seeing you.

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:51.800
Show us your best performance in your best dress.

00:17:52.590 --> 00:17:54.170
You got it!

00:17:58.180 --> 00:18:00.680
The Tropical Beach Coord.

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:04.680
It's a pop dress overflowing with playfulness.

00:18:05.230 --> 00:18:07.440
Fun is the best!

00:23:56.330 --> 00:24:00.290
Yuzu-senpai's performance and surprise were just the best!

00:24:00.290 --> 00:24:05.420
A dress to bring a smile to your face, 
the Tropical Beach Coord.

00:24:05.420 --> 00:24:09.340
Yuzu, I sincerely congratulate you on your Star Wings.

00:24:10.720 --> 00:24:11.930
Even though we're idols...

00:24:11.930 --> 00:24:13.180
There's a test?!

00:24:13.180 --> 00:24:16.430
A horrifying punishment awaits those who fail!

00:24:16.430 --> 00:24:17.720
Eh?!

00:24:17.720 --> 00:24:19.970
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:19.970 --> 00:24:22.270
Venus Ark's scary rumor.

00:24:22.270 --> 00:24:24.520
Become the first-star idol!
